egal","gladiator":"not_legal","historic":"not_legal","legacy":"legal","modern":"legal","oathbreaker":"legal","oldschool":"not_legal","pauper":"not_legal","paupercommander":"not_legal","penny":"legal","pioneer":"not_legal","predh":"legal","premodern":"not_legal","standard":"not_legal","standardbrawl":"not_legal","timeless":"not_legal","tlr":"not_legal","vintage":"legal"},"loyalty":null,"mana_cost":"{6}{G}{G}","name":"Terastodon","oracle_id":"17975a20-2c13-4325-be1e-0bcda5063a2d","oracle_text":"When this creature enters, you may destroy up to three target noncreature permanents. For each permanent put into a graveyard this way, its controller creates a 3/3 green Elephant creature token.","power":"9","produced_mana":[],"released_at":"2021-04-23","toughness":"9","type_line":"Creature — Elephant"},{"cmc":4.0,"color_identity":[],"colors":[],"defense":null,"keywords":[],"layout":"normal","legalities":{"alchemy":"not_legal","brawl":"not_legal","commander":"legal","competitivebrawl":"not_legal","duel":"legal","future":"not_legal","gladiator":"not_legal","historic":"not_legal","legacy":"legal","modern":"legal","oathbreaker":"legal","oldschool":"not_legal","pauper":"not_legal","paupercommander":"not_legal","penny":"legal","pioneer":"not_legal","predh":"legal","premodern":"not_legal","standard":"not_legal","standardbrawl":"not_legal","timeless":"not_legal","tlr":"not_legal","vintage":"legal"},"loyalty":null,"mana_cost":"{4}","name":"Vedalken Orrery","oracle_id":"60d640a4-032b-4279-ac75-8f200ca776fb","oracle_text":"You may cast spells as though they had flash.","power":null,"produced_mana":[],"released_at":"2022-07-08","toughness":null,"type_line":"Artifact"}],"fixture_kind":"public_exact-list_card_data","rulings":[{"comment":"If you don't have a commander, Arcane Signet's ability produces no mana.","oracle_id":"0bc7f093-bef0-4f1a-852c-4b75ebf54838","published_at":"2020-11-10","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"If you have two commanders, the ability adds one mana of any color in their combined color identities.","oracle_id":"0bc7f093-bef0-4f1a-852c-4b75ebf54838","published_at":"2020-11-10","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"If your commander is a card that has no colors in its color identity, Arcane Signet's ability produces no mana. It doesn't produce {C}.","oracle_id":"0bc7f093-bef0-4f1a-852c-4b75ebf54838","published_at":"2020-11-10","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"The targeted permanents may be controlled by different players.","oracle_id":"17975a20-2c13-4325-be1e-0bcda5063a2d","published_at":"2010-03-01","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"If a targeted permanent has indestructible or regenerates, its controller won't get an Elephant token for it. Similarly, if the targeted permanent is destroyed but a replacement effect moves it to a different zone instead of its owner's graveyard, its controller won't get an Elephant token for it.","oracle_id":"17975a20-2c13-4325-be1e-0bcda5063a2d","published_at":"2013-07-01","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"The controller of Vedalken Orrery can cast nonland artifact, creature, enchantment, and sorcery cards any time they could cast an instant. This includes on other players' turns and during the upkeep step, draw step, combat phase, and end step.","oracle_id":"60d640a4-032b-4279-ac75-8f200ca776fb","published_at":"2004-12-01","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"This applies only to casting spells. It does not, for example, change when you may activate abilities that can only be activated \"any time you could cast a sorcery\".","oracle_id":"60d640a4-032b-4279-ac75-8f200ca776fb","published_at":"2010-06-15","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"If the target artifact or enchantment is an illegal target by the time Nature's Claim tries to resolve, the spell doesn't resolve. No player gains 4 life. If the target is legal but not destroyed (most likely because it has indestructible), its controller does gain 4 life.","oracle_id":"6d4e558e-9109-4918-a082-fdcbaffd516b","published_at":"2021-03-19","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"Although Darksteel Citadel is an artifact, it can't be cast as a spell. Playing it follows the normal rules for playing a land.","oracle_id":"8dc067bf-f78f-4ac4-b6e7-b305c42cf0bc","published_at":"2014-07-18","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"Can be used on artifact creatures.","oracle_id":"cd8ae9f2-edac-473a-8846-c08219e617c3","published_at":"2004-10-04","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"A player's \"opening hand\" is the hand of cards the player has after all players have taken mulligans. If players have any cards in hand that allow actions to be taken with them from a player's opening hand, the starting player takes all such actions first in any order, followed by each other player in turn order. Then the first turn begins.","oracle_id":"f4e32fc1-1b8d-441e-8e76-71f19f98e925","published_at":"2024-09-20","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"If your opponent discards a card while you control Leyline of the Void, abilities that check whether a card is discarded (such as Hollow One, or a madness ability of the discarded card) still work, even though that card never reaches that player's graveyard. In addition, spells or abilities that check the characteristics of the discarded card can find that card in exile.","oracle_id":"f4e32fc1-1b8d-441e-8e76-71f19f98e925","published_at":"2024-09-20","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"Tokens can still die while Leyline of the Void is on the battlefield.","oracle_id":"f4e32fc1-1b8d-441e-8e76-71f19f98e925","published_at":"2024-09-20","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"While Leyline of the Void is on the battlefield, nontoken creatures your opponents control won't die. They'll be exiled instead. Abilities that would trigger when those creatures die won't trigger.","oracle_id":"f4e32fc1-1b8d-441e-8e76-71f19f98e925","published_at":"2024-09-20","source":"wotc"}],"schema_version":1,"source":"Scryfall Oracle/rulings subset for offline tests"}
